  "limitations": [
    "Synthetic OCR/QR mail only; shared production host and low scheduling weight, not a production traffic capacity guarantee.",
    "DNS/authentication, external reputation, LLM, TLS and Proton delivery excluded.",
    "Models and local scanners enabled. AV and signatures are shared existing services outside measured cgroups; OCR uses a separate exact-source candidate service.",
    "SMTP and OCR counters sampled every 100 ms; final CPU sample may precede SMTP process exit; model loading excluded from per-message analysis times.",
    "Shipped OCR confinement reused; explicit private socket replaces socket activation. Protected reads and IPv4 socket denial verified inside worker.",
    "No filtering-quality or real CAPEv2 claim.",
    "The 128-message workload lasted 74.477 seconds, using one identical image/QR fixture and four retrying clients. It is not an hours-long mixed-traffic soak or maximum server capacity measurement.",
